    <section class="brand-lab__section" id="brand-voice" aria-labelledby="brand-voice-title">
      <div class="brand-lab__section-heading">
        <p class="brand-lab__index">13 / Voice</p>
        <div><BrandHeading level={2} role="h3" id="brand-voice-title">Casual, nerdy, specific, honest</BrandHeading><p>Explain the operating consequence and tradeoff without inflating the claim.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-lab__voice-grid">
        <article><span>Use</span><p>“The brief keeps getting rebuilt because source context is scattered. Start with a process change; add an agent only when the review boundary is explicit.”</p></article>
        <article><span>Avoid</span><p>“Unlock a seamless, cutting-edge AI workforce that revolutionizes productivity.”</p></article>
      </div>
      <ol class="brand-lab__copy-sequence"><li>Operating consequence</li><li>System choice</li><li>Tradeoff</li><li>Evidence boundary</li><li>Specific next action</li></ol>
